'''Drednaw''' (Japanese: '''カジリガメ''' ''Kajirigame'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

