==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SWSH Promo|Drednaw|47}}, one of the {{TCG|SWSH Black Star Promos}}; both cards have the Jaw Lock attack.
*{{m|Jaw Lock}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Drednaw}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

